# Preserve byte-exact public assets, documents and frozen evaluation inputs.
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.onnx binary
*.safetensors binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
# Sealed audits and frozen inputs are hashed as bytes; never rewrite line ends.
*.json -text
